      <div type="clause" n="32.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 32.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac þæt unriht alegde ure hlaford; þæt he ma mote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But this practice has been stopped by our lord. May he succeed in stopping more!</ab>
